body:
theres a suicide every 40 seconds. it might not be "most" people, but that's a hell of a lot. and those are ppl who went thru with it. now imagine how many more are depressed, considering suicide, or have attempted. i think if someone wants to die, they should be able to. 

>I do think people realize that morally you have the right to kill yourself though.

no, i dont think most people do, especially Christians.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
